If I do try again, and manage to stay away from meat for the first two 
weeks or so... I could conceivable see my desire for meat diminishing,
but then, I would also note that if you can manage to stay away from
solid foods for 3 or 4 days, you will also see your desire for food 
dimish.

any comments?

